OL,3,GNEWSADoctor cleared of sexually
OL,4,Aharassing students
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior doctor has been cleared by a
OL,7,Ftribunal of sexually harassing four
OL,8,Fmedical students.
OL,10,FA Medical Practitioners Tribunal
OL,11,FService (MPTS) panel found that
OL,12,Fphysical contact by Dr Adam Chesters
OL,13,Fwas not meant in a sexual way, but that
OL,14,Fhe had committed misconduct.
OL,16,FChesters was handed a warning over the
OL,17,Fincidents, which took place during
OL,18,Feducation sessions in Cambridge and
OL,19,FEdinburgh.
